  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "This series is called House Arrest, and its hero is Arkady, the mayor of Sineozersk, a small Russian town; he grew up in a communal flat, one flat shared by several families. But we start in the nineteen eighties: Samson, then just little Vanya, sees his father come home from Hungary with presents, and little Arkady can only watch. Let's listen in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Привет, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Привет! Смотри, что у меня есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Ого, магнитофон! Японский!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Здравствуйте! Как там в Венгрии?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Хорошо! Там всё нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Папа, а жвачку ты привёз?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Жвачку? Денег не хватило.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Ну, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Ладно, держи. Вот, смотри.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Сколько жвачки! Класс!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "А это тебе. Машинка!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Спасибо, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Со всеми поделись поровну, понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "А можно я пойду посмотрю?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Нельзя? Ладно, пойду учить уроки.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go back through it slowly. The door bangs, and the whole corridor knows that Vanya's father is home from abroad.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Привет, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi, Dad!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Смотри, что у меня есть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look what I've got.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Ого, магнитофон! Японский!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wow, a tape recorder! A Japanese one!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Здравствуйте!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Как там в Венгрии?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How was it there in Hungary?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Хорошо! Там всё нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good! Everything's fine over there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Папа, а жвачку ты привёз?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dad, did you bring any gum?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Жвачку? Денег не хватило.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Gum? I didn't have enough money.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Ну, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, come on, Dad!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Ладно, держи.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, here you go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Вот, смотри.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There, look.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Сколько жвачки! Класс!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So much gum! Cool!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "А это тебе. Машинка!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And this is for you. A toy car!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Спасибо, папа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks, Dad!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "father",
      "t": "Со всеми поделись поровну, понял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Share it all equally with everyone, understand?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "samson",
      "t": "Понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "А можно я пойду посмотрю?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can I go and have a look?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Нельзя? Ладно, пойду учить уроки.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not allowed? All right, I'll go and do my homework.'",
      "gap": 0.9
